  INSTALL -->|"Install-CopilotContextFilterHook"| COPILOT
  COPILOTHOOKS --> COPILOT

  subgraph hooks["hooks/ — junctioned into Claude + Codex; reached by Grok via compat"]
    LIBPY["_lib.py\nproject detection, stdin-JSON, projects.toml loader, NO_WINDOW spawn flag\nnormalize_payload: Grok camelCase -> Claude shape (#491)\nSECRET_PATTERNS · gh_json · powershell_exe — one copy per fact (#561)"]
    PROJECTS["projects.toml\nper-project ports/gates/never-kill ports"]
    RUNHOOK["run-hook.ps1 — Claude Code shim (Git Bash routes through it)"]
    HOOKFILES["pre_commit_no_ai_trailer · secret_scan_guard · safe_kill_guard ·\nvenv_discipline · py_syntax_check · notify_on_idle · session_state ·\nblock_askuserquestion_chief · chief_handover_sessionstart · …"]
    SLACKPY["slack_notify.py -> notify_complete.py -> work_summary.py"]
    CONVPY["conversation memory engine (projects.toml opt-in, #586)\nconversation_capture (Stop) -> capture + full-session-id header\nsession_index (SessionStart) -> conversation_index -> index.md + index.json\nconversation_search — FTS5 over digests + transcripts, returns resume cmd"]
    BACKUPPY["backup_private.py + run-backup-daily.bat (#590)\nNOT a hook — a daily scheduled program\ngit-ignored set -> deny-list -> bulk-dir guard\nhardlinked dated snapshots + latest/ mirror\nself-verifying: sample re-hash · zero-file regression · 3-state freshness"]
  end
  hooks --> CLAUDE
  hooks --> CODEX
  HOOKFILES --> LIBPY
  HOOKFILES --> PROJECTS
  RUNHOOK --> HOOKFILES
  BACKUPPY --> LIBPY
  BACKUPPY --> PROJECTS
  BACKUPPY -->|success to #log, failure to #attention| SLACKPY
  BACKUPPY -->|"E: repo residue -> C: ; C: transcripts -> E:"| BACKUPDEST["C:/Users/rober/backup/fleet-private\nE:/backup/claude-transcripts\ndated snapshots + latest/ + manifest.json"]

